    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/ebd8fc1e53f03d3a7fcaa2c929b545a6.poster.avif?t=1726934837\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/ebd8fc1e53f03d3a7fcaa2c929b545a6.webm?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/ebd8fc1e53f03d3a7fcaa2c929b545a6.mp4?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> It's a roguelite action-adventure bullet hell game where you can develop your characters and choose from a variety of elemental characters and skills. Using elemental powers strategically is crucial for winning each run, and selecting different elements and skills every time ensures a unique play experience. And your ultimate goal is to save the universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Bond</h2>You control two elemental characters, utilizing their bonds to destroy enemies and gather their souls to feed the planets and the universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8bb47c546d0738a672ebf20ee6d4a811.poster.avif?t=1726934837\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8bb47c546d0738a672ebf20ee6d4a811.webm?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8bb47c546d0738a672ebf20ee6d4a811.mp4?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planets</h2>There are dead planets that send robots to attack you; You give your souls to revive these planets, once they are revived, they are saved and no longer attacks you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8f7fca4437ab69176f139cd28eea4f3c.poster.avif?t=1726934837\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8f7fca4437ab69176f139cd28eea4f3c.webm?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8f7fca4437ab69176f139cd28eea4f3c.mp4?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/ebd8fc1e53f03d3a7fcaa2c929b545a6.poster.avif?t=1726934837\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/ebd8fc1e53f03d3a7fcaa2c929b545a6.webm?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/ebd8fc1e53f03d3a7fcaa2c929b545a6.mp4?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> It's a roguelite action-adventure bullet hell game where you can develop your characters and choose from a variety of elemental characters and skills. Using elemental powers strategically is crucial for winning each run, and selecting different elements and skills every time ensures a unique play experience. And your ultimate goal is to save the universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Bond</h2>You control two elemental characters, utilizing their bonds to destroy enemies and gather their souls to feed the planets and the universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8bb47c546d0738a672ebf20ee6d4a811.poster.avif?t=1726934837\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8bb47c546d0738a672ebf20ee6d4a811.webm?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8bb47c546d0738a672ebf20ee6d4a811.mp4?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planets</h2>There are dead planets that send robots to attack you; You give your souls to revive these planets, once they are revived, they are saved and no longer attacks you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8f7fca4437ab69176f139cd28eea4f3c.poster.avif?t=1726934837\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8f7fca4437ab69176f139cd28eea4f3c.webm?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987970/extras/8f7fca4437ab69176f139cd28eea4f3c.mp4?t=1726934837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Dual Survivors is a cosmic action game with rogue-lite and bullet hell elements. You play as an elemental duo, saving planets and making strategic choices to defeat billions of enemies. Navigate the cosmos and outlast death!",
